      <p source="#source-750-908"><seg source="#source-750-825">御別後同二日夕方、すさき港ニ着船仕候。此地の一件ハ</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-831-891"><seg source="#source-825-831">石清</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-855-876">（中岡慎太郎）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-891-908">ニ申送候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-908-1009"><seg source="#source-908-920">御聞取可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-920-932">レ</note><seg source="#source-932-935">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-935-947">レ</note>下」小弟是より長崎へ廻り不日ニ上京仕候。</p>
      <p source="#source-1009-1167"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1009-1093"><rb><seg source="#source-1012-1021">御待可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1021-1033">レ</note><seg source="#source-1033-1036">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1036-1048">レ</note><seg source="#source-1048-1051">遣</seg></rb><rt>（おまちつかはさるべく）</rt></ruby>候。」別紙<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1108-1138"><rb>宜</rb><rt>（よろしく）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1138-1167">御頼申上候。謹言。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1167-1202" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p source="#source-1188-1202"><seg source="#source-1188-1202">八月五日</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1202-1228" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
        <p source="#source-1220-1228"><seg source="#source-1220-1228">楳拝</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1228-1260" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-1249-1260"><seg source="#source-1249-1260">謙吉様</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-1260-1317"><seg source="#source-1260-1287">右件直次郎ニ御伝奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1287-1299">レ</note><seg source="#source-1299-1317">頼候。以上。</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
